{"t":"ENTG","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"Entegris, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","employees":7700,"hq":"Billerica, MA, United States","website":"https://www.entegris.com","summary_en":"Entegris, Inc. provides advanced materials and process solutions for the semiconductor and other high-technology industries in North America, Taiwan, South Korea, Japan, China, Europe, and Southeast Asia. It operates in two segments, Materials Solutions (MS) and Advanced Purity Solutions (APS). The MS segment provides materials-based solutions, such as chemical vapor and atomic layer deposition materials, chemical mechanical planarization slurries and pads, ion implantation specialty gases, formulated etch and clean materials, and other specialty materials. The APS segment offers filtration, purification, and contamination-control solutions for the semiconductor manufacturing processes, semiconductor ecosystem, and other high-technology industries. The company's customers include logic and memory semiconductor device manufacturers, semiconductor equipment makers, gas and chemical manufacturing companies, and wafer grower companies; and outsourced semiconductor assembly and test facilities, flat panel display equipment makers, and manufacturers of hard disk drive components and devices. It serves manufacturers and suppliers in the solar and life science industries, electrical discharge machining customers, glass manufacturers, aerospace manufacturers, and manufacturers of biomedical implantation devices. Entegris, Inc. was founded in 1966 and is headquartered in Billerica, Massachusetts.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Entegris, Inc.는 북미, 대만, 한국, 일본, 중국, 유럽 및 동남아시아의 반도체 및 기타 첨단 기술 산업을 위한 첨단 소재 및 공정 솔루션을 제공합니다. 재료 솔루션(MS)과 고급 순도 솔루션(APS)의 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. MS 부문은 화학 기상 및 원자층 증착 재료, 화학 기계적 평탄화 슬러리 및 패드, 이온 주입 특수 가스, 공식 식각 및 청정 재료, 기타 특수 재료와 같은 재료 기반 솔루션을 제공합니다. APS 부문은 반도체 제조 공정, 반도체 생태계 및 기타 첨단 기술 산업을 위한 여과, 정화 및 오염 제어 솔루션을 제공합니다. 회사의 고객으로는 로직 및 메모리 반도체 장치 제조업체, 반도체 장비 제조업체, 가스 및 화학 제조 회사, 웨이퍼 재배 회사가 포함됩니다. 아웃소싱 반도체 조립 및 테스트 시설, 평면 패널 디스플레이 장비 제조업체, 하드 디스크 드라이브 부품 및 장치 제조업체. 태양광 및 생명 과학 산업의 제조업체 및 공급업체, 방전 가공 고객, 유리 제조업체, 항공우주 제조업체, 생체의학 이식 장치 제조업체에 서비스를 제공합니다. Entegris, Inc.는 1966년에 설립되었으며 매사추세츠 주 빌레리카에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":142.06,"mcap":21635737600.0,"pe":48.48464,"fpe":25.02237,"peg":0.7094,"ps":6.1383204,"pb":5.0096974,"ev_ebitda":24.778,"div":0.32,"beta":1.395,"hi52":186.94,"lo52":72.23},"fin":{"rev":3524699904.0,"rev_g":0.246,"eps_g":1.239,"gross":0.46974,"op":0.18636999,"net":0.11144,"roe":0.09553,"fcf":497137504.0,"cash":356500000.0,"debt":3360999936.0,"de":77.569,"eps":2.93,"feps":5.67732},"own":{"short":0.0714,"inst":1.0985501,"insider":0.00445},"analyst":{"n":14,"mean":188.35715,"median":192.5,"high":224.0,"low":135.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.6,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":10,"hold":1,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":10,"hold":2,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":8,"hold":2,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":8,"hold":2,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-31","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":220.0,"priorPriceTarget":205.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":200.0,"priorPriceTarget":195.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Goldman Sachs","ToGrade":"Sell","FromGrade":"Sell","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":135.0,"priorPriceTarget":120.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Truist Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":199.0,"priorPriceTarget":190.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade"